OL,3,GNEWSABusiness installs mock blue plaque
OL,4,Ain project protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disgruntled business owner has
OL,7,Finstalled a mock blue plaque to
OL,8,Frecognise the "unprecedented
OL,9,Fdisruption" caused by a three-year road
OL,10,Fclosure.
OL,12,FZack Iqbal has fitted the sign to his
OL,13,Fgarage First Stop Spanner Works on
OL,14,FFerry Hinksey Road in Oxford, which
OL,15,Fsits just off Botley Road.
OL,17,FBotley Road, a main route into the city
OL,18,Fcentre, reopened to traffic in
OL,19,FSeptember after much-maligned Network
OL,20,FRail works which first began in April
OL,21,F2023 and were beset by repeated delays.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,338,330,200,160,0,100
